==Description==
The '''Acid Bubbles Nametag''' is an unreleased nametag, originally meant to release in the [[Null & Void Event]]. As its name is not known, it will be called '''Acid Bubbles Nametag''' on the wiki due to it creating green bubbles.

The '''Acid Bubbles Nametag''' has green gradient text and a slightly translucent dark green outline. Green smoke and black particles come out of the text. A few green bubbles also come out of the nametag.

